From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 13:49:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Android: look for the interface's fallback faces in
 /system/fonts

Android has no fontconfig and keeps its faces directly in /system/fonts.
After the usual Linux locations, the same file names are looked for there;
Android's Arabic face (NotoNaskhArabic) and older CJK fallback
(DroidSansFallback) join the candidate lists by file name.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VMppwYqo1K6SotSRCS9UAd
